# Old Squarespace URLs → homepage sections
/services    /#services   301
/contact     /#contact    301

# Force canonical HTTPS www domain — prevents redirect-based non-indexing issues
http://ok-as.com/*     https://www.ok-as.com/:splat  301!
http://www.ok-as.com/* https://www.ok-as.com/:splat  301!
https://ok-as.com/*    https://www.ok-as.com/:splat  301!

# Cross-domain 301: legacy ok-autonomous.com → canonical www.ok-as.com
# (Netlify does NOT auto-redirect cross-domain aliases — must be explicit)
http://ok-autonomous.com/*      https://www.ok-as.com/:splat  301!
https://ok-autonomous.com/*     https://www.ok-as.com/:splat  301!
http://www.ok-autonomous.com/*  https://www.ok-as.com/:splat  301!
https://www.ok-autonomous.com/* https://www.ok-as.com/:splat  301!

# Canonicalize .html to pretty URLs (prevents duplicate content)
/team.html   /team        301!
/index.html  /            301!
